    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exiled Fighters</strong> is a 2D fighting game inspired by 90s classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dark future, civilization abandoned a planet consumed by crime and violence. The good citizens fled, leaving behind a lawless world ruled by the most dangerous and ruthless individuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training (Local)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player vs Player (Online)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player vs AI</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong></p></li></ul>",
